# Course Notes RAG

A study bot that answers questions from your own course notes, with citations back to the source pages.

**Status:** early development. Not usable yet.

## Planned features
- Ingest PDF and Markdown notes
- Answer questions using only your notes, with page citations
- Say "not in your notes" instead of guessing
- Bring-your-own API key
